{"id":"643408","name":"拌土豆粉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643408/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/643408/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆粉备用。","img":"images/643408/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/643408/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗中加入蒜末，辣椒面，葱花，白芝麻，烧烤料。","img":"images/643408/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味。","img":"images/643408/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，香醋，少许盐。","img":"images/643408/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/643408/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中水烧开。","img":"images/643408/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入土豆粉。","img":"images/643408/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开一两分钟后捞出。","img":"images/643408/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"土豆粉过凉水后盛入碗中，淋上酱汁捞匀即可。","img":"images/643408/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643408/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643408/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643408/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}